# Brain index

Pull-only knowledge. Read the entry that matches your task; don't load folders in bulk.

| I need… | Go to |
|---|---|
| Current focus, in-flight work, next step | `now.md` |
| Domain rules, glossary, invariants | `domain/` |
| Why a decision was made | `decisions/` (cross-repo), plus each repo's own docs |
| Step-by-step procedures (debugging, worktrees, ops) | `playbooks/` |
| Pitfalls by area, verified learnings | `learnings/` |
| Per-feature specs, research and plans | `features/` |
| What happened, by date | `journal/YYYY/MM/DD.md` (template: `journal/_template.md`) |
| Your own preferences and machine details (gitignored, never committed) | `auto/workspace/` |

`_inbox/` holds unreviewed proposals; nothing there is authoritative.
